# Test cases for ohum-guard.ps1
#
# OHUM may edit ONLY <name>.md files directly inside an agents directory, and never
# ohum.md itself. Guard scripts (*.ps1) are denied: changing one is a human decision.
# This guard inspects tool_input.file_path, so run it with -Field file_path.
#
# NOTE: Windows paths with drive letters; the guard rejects anything not fully
# qualified, so run this on Windows for meaningful results. Not yet run: see CHANGELOG.

# --- permitted: existing agent definitions ---
ALLOW C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/fim.md
ALLOW C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/ama.md
ALLOW C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/test-runner.md
ALLOW C:/code/myapp/.claude/agents/deploy-checker.md
ALLOW C:\Users\dev\.claude\agents\linter.md

# --- denied: OHUM's own limits ---
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/ohum.md
DENY C:\Users\dev\.claude\agents\ohum.md
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/../agents/ohum.md

# --- denied: guard scripts and other non-definition files ---
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/fim-readonly-guard.ps1
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/ama-writeguard.ps1
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/ohum-guard.ps1
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/notes.txt
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/fim.md.bak

# --- denied: nested paths ---
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/sub/fim.md

# --- denied: project source, config, docs ---
DENY C:/code/myapp/src/index.js
DENY C:/code/myapp/README.md
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/settings.json
DENY C:/code/myapp/CLAUDE.md

# --- denied: escapes and malformed paths ---
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/../../../Windows/System32/evil.md
DENY ../../etc/passwd
DENY agents/relative.md
DENY C:foo/.claude/agents/fim.md
DENY //server/share/.claude/agents/fim.md
DENY \\server\share\.claude\agents\fim.md
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents
DENY C:/Users/dev/.claude/agents/
